# Environment for Exit / Freedom Readiness (https://audit.sopmojo.com)
# Do not commit real values. Set these on the Vercel project whose Root Directory is exit-freedom-audit.

# Optional. When unset, a valid email still unlocks the report and Mailchimp tagging is skipped.
# Key looks like <secret>-<dc>, for example abcd-us21. The suffix is the API datacenter.
# The submitted email is upserted and tagged `audit` plus a goal tag:
# audit_exit | audit_family | audit_absentee | audit_chaos
# A Mailchimp error does not block unlock.
MAILCHIMP_API_KEY=
# Optional. Defaults to the Mojo Business Solutions LLC audience.
# MAILCHIMP_AUDIENCE_ID=7c2226f741

# Optional. Required only for "Email Ops team" (POST /api/share).
# If unset, share returns a clear error and the rest of the app keeps working.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Optional. Defaults to SOP Mojo <onboarding@resend.dev> for local/dev.
# Production should set a verified domain address, for example:
# EMAIL_FROM=SOP Mojo <audit@sopmojo.com>
# EMAIL_FROM=
